TI  - Do Offshore Wind Farms at Miaoli Cause Acoustic Deterrence to White Dolphin and Fish? Reveals a Short-Term Study at Taiwan Strait
T2  - 2025 IEEE UNDERWATER TECHNOLOGY, UT
LA  - English
CP  - 2025 International Symposium on Underwater Technology-UT-Annual
KW  - Marine Soundscapes
