TI  - Unstated impacts of the green energy industry on the habitat of a coastal delphinid: Turbid-turbulent wakes induced by offshore wind turbine foundations
T2  - AQUATIC CONSERVATION-MARINE AND FRESHWATER ECOSYSTEMS
LA  - English
KW  - environmental impact assessment
KW  - habitat utilization
