TI  - Rapid changes in environmental factors could affect the distribution of Taiwanese humpback dolphins (Sousa chinensis taiwanensis) off the coast of Yunlin, Taiwan
T2  - TAIWANIA
LA  - English
KW  - CONSERVATION
KW  - ABUNDANCE
